terms:
Survivors, 
The moment of judgment on the battlefield has arrived! The new skill "Liquidation Moment" is now officially live, bringing even greater finishing power to your battles! When enemies are suffering from multiple debuffs, "Liquidation Moment" has a chance to directly execute a lethal blow:
· Attacking enemies with 1/2/3/4 debuffs has a 10/15/30/45% chance to trigger Execution; 
· Execution Effect: 
  Zombies will be killed immediately;     
  Healthy or lightly injured human enemies will directly enter a critically injured state; 
  Critically injured human enemies will be killed immediately;   Enemies with a shield can withstand the execution, but will lose all shield value; 
· Attacking enemies within 2 tiles also has a 45% chance to inflict "Root", restricting enemy movement.
Facing an increasingly dangerous apocalyptic battlefield, exploit enemy weaknesses and execute the final reckoning in one strike!
